      en: ["The building was constructed in 1780 during the reign of Charles III.", "It is located in the heart of Tegucigalpa near the Central Park.", "The first silver coins were minted here shortly after its inauguration.", "During the 19th century, it briefly functioned as the seat of government.", "The National Library of Honduras was relocated here in 1900.", "It was officially designated as a National Historic Monument in 1993."],
